---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Host a conference"
  description="How a district bids to host REM or EUCO."
>
  <main id="content" class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker">Events</p>
      <h1>Host the next REM or EUCO</h1>
      <p>REM is a weekend: the city, the assembly, and a gala, with accommodation inside the fee. EUCO is the long one, five days and usually more than 500 people, with workshops, the gala dinner, and the gala party.</p>
    </header>
    <ol>
      <li>Read the bylaws. They are on the current site’s resources page.</li>
      <li>Ask events@rotaracteurope.eu for the event manual.</li>
      <li>Talk to the Events Committee at that same address before you spend money.</li>
      <li>Fill in the bid papers and get your local Rotary club behind them.</li>
      <li>Complete the Sustainable Event Checklist.</li>
      <li>Write the budget.</li>
      <li>Build the presentation from the template the committee sends.</li>
      <li>Submit the official form. The live form is still on <a href="https://rotaracteurope.eu/host-conference/">the current host page</a>.</li>
    </ol>
  </main>
</Base>
